user_prompt:
Canonicalize the following medical chart text. Requirements:
- Preserve verbatim content; do not add or remove facts.
- Detect section headers (case-insensitive) with optional trailing colon.
- Recognize headers: Reason for Appointment, Assessments, Treatment, Notes, Clinical Notes, Immunization/Immunizations, Follow Up, History of Present Illness (HPI), History, Review of Systems, Vital Signs/Vitals, Examination, Current Medications, Past Medical History, Family History, Labs.
- If no header for a block, set section_name to "Uncategorized".
- For Immunizations section: split each line containing "given by" into its own excerpt.
- For lines starting with "LAB:", group contiguous lab lines into one excerpt per lab block.
- Excerpts should be 1-10 lines and maintain original order.
Return ONLY this JSON object (no markdown, no extra text):
{
  "chart_canonical_package": {
    "excerpts": [{"excerpt_id":"ex_0001","section_name":"...","text_verbatim":"..."}],
    "section_index": {"Section": ["ex_0001"]},
    "canonicalization": {"schema_version":"1.0.0","source_format":"plain_text","normalization_notes": []}
  }
}

CHART TEXT:
{{raw_chart_text}}
